event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":81,"item_id":"rs_02607578b8403db5016aca7b01278c8190b7a93cd5399f7a54","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering helper implementation**\n\nI'm thinking about implementing a reusable body parsing helper for POST and PATCH requests. This could optimize the process by generalizing how we handle data. Maybe it would be best to keep it simple to avoid complexity while ensuring it effectively restructures the original input. I've got some time left to make this happen, so I’ll work on finding a balance between efficiency and straightforwardness with this implementation."}

